[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784493171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105130#issuecomment-2784493171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105130","id":2784493171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l9_5z","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T20:02:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T21:04:58Z","body":"@bruvzg ~~Spaces as `+` is not just for web forms, it is also used in web browsers for web addresses.~~ TIL the part after `?` is called a web form.\r\n\r\nIf this is undesired then we need to at least make it an option probably as a function parameter.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784493171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784517424","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105130#issuecomment-2784517424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105130","id":2784517424,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l-F0w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T20:13:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T20:13:46Z","body":"> Spaces as + is not just for web forms, it is also used in web browsers for web addresses.\r\n\r\nNever seen space encoded like this, and it seems to be mentioned only in context of webforms - https://www.w3.org/TR/html4/interact/forms.html#h-17.13.4.1\r\n\r\nBut if it's used by something I guess it make sense to have the option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784517424/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784550281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105130#issuecomment-2784550281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105130","id":2784550281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l-N2J","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T20:29:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T20:29:13Z","body":"I don't really know what the standards are for these formats, but just trying out searches on a few websites, multiple words seem to be combined with \"+\" in the URL - for example, searching \"remove space\" in Godot's PRs goes to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pulls?q=remove+space.\r\n\r\nIt might be a breaking change for the gdscript binding if that doesn't keep the URL behavior, especially since the documentation mentions URLs specifically: \"Decodes the string from its URL-encoded format. This method is meant to properly decode the parameters in a URL when receiving an HTTP request.\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784550281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.